# TraderOS Agent

This project is a lightweight starter agent scaffold for the TraderOS workspace.

## Quick start

```bash
python -m venv .venv
. .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
python -m traderos_agent "Analyze AAPL and suggest a trading plan"
```

## Project layout

- `src/traderos_agent/agent.py` contains the base agent logic
- `src/traderos_agent/__main__.py` exposes the CLI entrypoint
- `tests/test_agent.py` validates the starter behavior

## Notes

The scaffold intentionally avoids heavy dependencies so it is easy to extend with market data, strategy code, or LLM-backed reasoning.
